        "description": "Twakomeje kwumva ingene Imana izogarukana Isirayeli mu gihugu. Umuvugishwa n'Imana Yeremiya yiguriye itongo ari mw'ibohero ariko agira ibibazo mu mutima wiwe kuko Imana yamutegetse kwigurira itongo kandi Imana yagira itange igihugu mu maboko y'abansi .Naho Yeremiya yagize ico kibazo yumviye Imana kandi yaramwishuye.Twarabonye kandi ivy'aba Rekabu. Imana ibwira Yeremiya kwandika amajambo yose yamubariye mu muzingo w'igitabo kugira ngo ayashikirize ab'i Buyuda, Baruki umukarani wiwe yandika ayo majambo, aca amusaba kuyasomera abantu bose baraho .",
